   "subject": "Re: [stan-users] CmdStan v2.13.1 released!",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Thanks Daniel, works fine in the Julia/Satn.jl setting.<div><br></div><div>The only minor thing I had to fix is that CmdStan simulations that don’t need data can no longer have an unused ‘<b style=\"font-family:Menlo;font-size:11px\">data file=binormal_1.data.R`</b>component on the command line.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div>Rob</div><div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Dec 13, 2016, at 21:36, Daniel Lee &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bea...@alum.mit.edu</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Hi all,</span><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">CmdStan v2.13.1 is now available! Download a tarball or zip file from GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.13.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.13.1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459246672000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3BEk0W-DaTOBYYQZkM0vXn\">https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.13.1</a></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Some of the noticeable features include:</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><ul><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">CmdStan</font></li><ul><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">bin/stansummary can now produce a csv file</font></li><li>Stan programs can now have undefined functions where the definitions are included in an external C++ header file</li></ul><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Stan language:</font></li><ul><li>Vectorization of all unary functions</li><li>Compound declare and define</li><li>Matrix exponential is now available: matrix_exp() </li></ul></ul><div><br></div></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">For the full release notes, see:</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><ul><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">CmdStan: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.13.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.13.1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459246672000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3BEk0W-DaTOBYYQZkM0vXn\">https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.13.1</a></font></li><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Stan: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.13.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.13.1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459246672000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-aXDMklKxvrlPlrWO-OE9\">https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.13.1</a></font></li><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Math: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/math/releases/tag/v2.13.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/math/releases/tag/v2.13.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459246672000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2HO1Hzn_LE0kW3BzBCIu0d\">https://github.com/stan-dev/math/releases/tag/v2.13.0</a></font></li></ul><div><br></div></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Thanks,</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Stan Development Team</div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Stan users mailing list&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">stan-users+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">stan-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459246672000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2x9B4SZDmhNeN8AluU8Fzs\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></blockquote></div><br></div></div>"
